  "description": "<p>ViniHNS’ Little Addons ported to 3.9!!!</p>\n<p>Original file: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1678-little-addons/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Little Addons</a></p>\n<p><em><strong>The Additions:</strong></em></p>\n<p>**Weapons:</p>\n<p><em><strong>Glock 21</strong></em> - Basically the glock 17 chambered in .45 ACP (Mechanic LL2/LL3)</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/7250-screenshot-4-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/7250-screenshot-4-png/\" alt=\"7250-screenshot-4-png\" /></a></p>\n<p><em><strong>Colt M4 chambered in .50 Beowulf</strong></em> - It’s not .50 BMG (Mechanic LL3).<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/7354-screenshot-2-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/7354-screenshot-2-png/\" alt=\"7354-screenshot-2-png\" /></a></p>\n<p><em><strong>VKS Vykhlop 12.7x55 Sniper Rifle</strong></em> - <strong>Big boy</strong> Ash-12 (Prapor LL3/LL4).</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/7251-screenshot-10-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/7251-screenshot-10-png/\" alt=\"7251-screenshot-10-png\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>Ammo:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>STs-130:</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>STs-130 12.7x55 Cartridge</em> -</strong> Standard bullet for the VKS. Damage: 125 <strong>|</strong> Penetration: 35</p>\n<p><strong><em>STs-130VPS 12.7x55 Cartridge</em> -</strong> increased penetration (expect <strong>HUGE</strong> bullet drop). Damage: 100 <strong>|</strong> Penetration: 67</p>\n<p><strong><em>STs-130PT2 12.7x55 Cartridge</em> - i</strong>ncreased accuracy (expect <strong>BIG</strong> bullet drop). Damage: 110 | Penetration: 42</p>\n<p><em>Quote the Ash-12 and the RSh-12 would not be able to feed or chamber rounds designed for the VKS due to significant length differences in the bullet component</em> <strong>.50 Beowulf:</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>.50 Beowulf HP</em>-</strong> Hollow point bullet. Damage: 125 <strong>|</strong> Penetration: 8</p>\n<p><strong><em>.50 Beowulf FMJ</em>-</strong> Standart bullet. Damage: 100 <strong>|</strong> Penetration: 28</p>\n<p><strong><em>.50 Beowulf Hydra-Shok JHP</em>-</strong> Hollow point bullet with a tip. Damage: 115 <strong>|</strong> Penetration: 14</p>\n<p><strong>Helmets:</strong></p>\n<p><em><strong>Rusty Bucket</strong></em> - A bucket to protect you from many bullets.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/7252-screenshot-91-png/\" alt=\"7252-screenshot-91-png\" /></p>\n<p><em><strong>Stahlhelm M42 helmet</strong></em> - This helmet was used in WW2 by the germans.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/7254-screenshot-12-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/7254-screenshot-12-png/\" alt=\"7254-screenshot-12-png\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong><em>Cardboard Helmet</em> -</strong> This helmet offers about as much protection as a wet napkin against a bullet.</p>\n",
